        "title": "Contact a resource provider",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Find the Place or Programme/service in Discover and open its details. If the provider supplied contact information, the details can show a phone number, email, WhatsApp, website or external link. Use the available provider channel to confirm current hours, fees, places and registration. The Guide cannot message or register with the provider or book a seat for you, and I cannot verify an in-app provider chat or booking here."
        ],
