          "A Programme/service may have profile criteria, and a member-only one also requires an active membership at a linked Place. An account role alone does not bypass those checks. The Guide cannot confirm your eligibility for a particular listing from chat; open its current details if visible and confirm participation requirements with the provider. Eligibility is separate from booking or registration."
