    "message": "High-Detail Town Maps provides prepared town-map files in PNG and PDF formats. Sign in with access to My Directory; these downloads are separate from the contents of your own My Maps.\n\n1. Open High-Detail Town Maps in the dashboard navigation.\n\n2. Use Search town maps to enter a town name or map code, then find the matching town card.\n\n3. Check the town and covered areas, preview and PNG/PDF file sizes. Use Wi-Fi if a large download would use too much mobile data.\n\n4. Select Download PNG for an image or Download PDF for a PDF file, then wait for the browser to start the download.\n\n5. Check your browser’s downloads and open the file to confirm that you chose the intended town and format.\n\nThese are prepared town-map files; they do not add your saved resources, Personal places or private map notes. Downloading one does not create or change a My Map.\n\nFor your own mapped resources and layout, open an owned My Map and use Export View or its map export controls. Export Map Assets produces a resource workbook rather than this town-map PNG/PDF.\n\nIf search finds no maps, shorten the town name or use Clear search. If the catalogue cannot load, use Try again. If a download fails, check the connection and retry the required format; the preview alone is not confirmation that the full file downloaded.",
