    "message": "Sign in to use account Updates. Saved-resource notifications, calendar review decisions and support Messages are separate parts of the app.\n\n1. Open Help → Inbox and select Updates.\n\n2. Open Notification preferences and enable Saved schedule changes or Saved resource changes as needed. Each choice is saved when you change its checkbox.\n\n3. If the panel says in-app notifications are disabled in Profile, select Open Profile. Under Pilot preferences, enable In-app and select Save notification preferences.\n\n4. Return to Inbox → Updates → Notification preferences. If a resource you want to hear about is under Muted resources, select Unmute for that resource.\n\n5. Use Refresh updates to check your current Inbox. Open the relevant resource or calendar action on an update before deciding what to change.\n\nChecks run after changes rather than promising an instant alert. Enabling a category or unmuting starts from current information and does not produce catch-up alerts.\n\nThese choices do not move My Plans entries or register you with a provider. The Guide can explain them but cannot change them from chat.\n\nEmail, WhatsApp and SMS choices in Profile record preferences only in the current pilot; external delivery remains disabled. Inbox updates do not send device push messages.\n\nIf preference saving reports an error, reload the controls and check the stored choices before retrying.",
