    "message": "Use the account that submitted the report, or recover the guest report with its private code. Account reports are available only to you and authorised support reviewers.\n\n1. Open Help → Inbox. For an account inbox, select Messages.\n\n2. Select the report by its title. Use Refresh inbox if you need to refresh the list; Load older reports appears when another page is available.\n\n3. Read its messages and status. Use Load newer messages when offered, and select Mark shown messages read after reading the messages displayed.\n\n4. If a reply is needed, enter Your reply and select Send reply. Keep it about the app issue and leave private details out.\n\n5. When the problem is fixed for you, select Mark resolved. If a fix-available update has not solved it, select Problem remains — reopen instead.\n\n6. If an already resolved problem returns, open its report and select Reopen report. Check the updated status before continuing the conversation.\n\nAn unresolved report offers the reply form; reopen a resolved report before adding a new reply. Marking shown messages read does not claim that unseen messages were read.\n\nUse Refresh conversation to check current replies and status. If an action reports an error, refresh before retrying.\n\nA proposed fix still needs human approval and release verification before a fix-available update. A support status is not a promise that your reported behaviour has already been fixed.",
