    "reviewed": "2026-10-02",
    "queryRequiresAny": [
      "group"
    ],
    "message": "You need permission to edit the exact Group. Managing a member listing or having coordination-group membership does not by itself grant this Group’s editing rights.\n\n1. Open Manage My Resources → Groups and choose Edit on the exact Group if available.\n\n2. Review Profile and Visibility. Keep only approved public details and choose the intended Public or Target region/s audience.\n\n3. Open Members and review the selected Places/Offerings. Search eligible public resources to add a member, or remove a selected member when intended.\n\n4. Select Preview and check the resulting collection, audience and visibility, then select Save Group.\n\n5. Wait for the update and reopen the Group to verify it. If a save fails, review its error and current members before trying again.\n\nEditing the Group’s selected members does not edit or delete the member resources themselves and does not transfer their ownership.\n\nThe saved Group’s Access panel uses its separate permission-checked Add access and Remove actions. These actions save independently of profile edits.\n\nIf the intention is to hide or delete the collection, use the related visibility article. Do not use a public Group Delete control to archive a governance coordination group.\n\nNo staff-only audience is offered in this public Resource Group editor. The Guide cannot edit the collection or its members for you.",
